{"v":4,"catch":"相信下落就是希望，只為和「你」相遇——","desc":"宇宙中的人類莫瑪，為了尋找她唯一的朋友——「你」，進而探索深達100萬層以上的地下世界「Million Depth」。然而隨著世界線的重重變化，莫瑪的命運也將截然不同。\n\n過去所作出的決定，將會對未來造成意想不到的影響。更是還會和別的世界線產生交錯。你需要在重重世界線中搜索碎片化的真相，解開所有謎團。\n\n打造自己的原創武器，攻克極具戰略性的時停戰鬥吧！","publisher":"PLAYISM","release":"2026-12-03","genres":["動作","策略"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔15歳級","size":"Switch 2 2.5GB / Switch 2.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f8619e41e6cfde9d7e7256797a0418369d9e86e4509825d2b138abab4d9617e7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/468cb00346560757c0ac60a723bb45561e8189310719e21a993b132fa34b59b0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5be0ed026d3771b35827df7387a9ab845ddaec72c8e9bd808f3f6794ae5055e8.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5b627327772ed414f32b43a9fd214869ef2a05c33d18cbffd2869431fdea85b6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/cf98af5f7e814c5abdae2e360af65f3059021140aed32012644a310ff5693439.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/d54b92ecd6bf53817df0743c833871d2e2a3843cf40b02d62b06d4968592ad44.jpg"],"titleId":"0100896028e9e000","demo":["70030000025842"],"dlc":[]}